<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/viz-2/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "विष् II /viṣ/ (U. pr. /viveṣṭi/ /viviṣe/ —III- pf. /viveṣa/ /viveṣe/- aor. /aviṣṭat/ /avikṣata/) 1) делать- действовать 2) течь (о воде) 3) служить 4) управлять 5) есть, поедать"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/viz-2/dict/koch/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "विष् I /viṣ/ (P. pr. /veṣati/ —I- fut. /vekṣ-yati/- pf. /viveṣa/- aor. /avikṣat/- pp. /viṣṭa/ ) брызгать, кропить"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "koch" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/viz-2/dict/koch/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
